<section class="section" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <details><summary>What does the $5 cover?</summary><p>Everything on our side: your price range, writing and posting the listing, answering buyer messages, and negotiating. There are no commissions or other fees.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I get paid?</summary><p>The buyer pays you directly when you meet for pickup — 100% of the sale price is yours. We never touch the sale money. The only thing you pay us is the $5, through a payment link we send in Messenger.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if it doesn't sell?</summary><p>You've still paid only the $5, and nothing else. If it hasn't sold after a week, we may lower the price by up to 10% — we always message you first, and it never goes below your floor without your approval.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do I need the Facebook app?</summary><p>You need a Facebook account to chat with us in Messenger, but not necessarily the app — Messenger also works in a web browser. Sales are local pickup only; we don't ship and we don't take your item.</p></details>
  </div>
